5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I need to understand why we feel crowded or alone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who pays for what when the bill comes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I need to know about the bathrooms and meal times.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I hate losing days to travel and waiting.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to know the total cost before we commit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, do you think the room layout affects our mood?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I agree, clarity is key to avoiding arguments.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, yes, I just need a place to sit that isn't a bed.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I am looking at the travel times to see if it's worth it.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, I will check the pricing to see if it fits our budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the time alone in the shared-house year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check what separately booked rooms cost last time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the bathing hours and bathroom provision.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the ferry sailings and train time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the pricing of offshore houses let whole.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Also, I will check how last year's days ran.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,And I will look at the all-in rates against meals bought separately.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
