35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Last year we barely spoke. The shared house year had no privacy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more. All-in rates are unfair to light eaters.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"One bathroom for the whole building. Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two days. The train is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Island houses are 5,400 yen a head. Valley inns are 17,000 yen all-in.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, six o'clock dinner sounds strict. Do you have flexibility?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, 17,000 yen is high, but it includes meals. Is that better?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I am worried about the cold water and the single bathroom.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I prefer the train. Two days on a ferry is too long.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, the island is cheaper, but the travel time is a risk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The city option lets us drift apart, which I want to avoid.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The island bill is one lump sum. That is easier to divide fairly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The inn has a timetable. I need to know if I can sleep in.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The city has trains every few minutes. No waiting for buses.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn is expensive, but the cost is predictable.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I think we need a place where we are together but not forced.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The island house keeps us in one building.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am hesitant about the bathroom situation. It sounds stressful.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,The city feels too fragmented. I want us to move together.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,The island seems like the best balance of cost and togetherness.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
